{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13221380","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13221380","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1322138001:1":{"text":"여신님께 찬미를. 오셨군요! 맥심 형제님과 저는 준비가 끝났습니다.","source_cn":"赞美女神，你们来了！希望这次我和马克西姆兄弟准备得足够充分。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x82384CD45EB463B6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1322138002:1":{"text":"솔직히 말하면, 조금 무섭네요. 심장이 너무 빨리 뛰어요... 하지만 불평하지 않겠습니다. 이것은 제가 해야 할 일이자 여신님께서 인도하신 바른 길이니까요.","source_cn":"说实话，我有些害怕，心跳得很快……但我没什么可抱怨的，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xED127AEBCB327BE3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1322138003:1":{"text":"여신님께서 우리를 보호하실 겁니다.","source_cn":"女神会保佑我们的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7EE38C391F6B2D00","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1322138004:1":{"text":"저도 그렇게 믿습니다. 캐롤라이나 양, 길을 안내해 주시지요.","source_cn":"我对此坚信不疑。卡列琳娜女士，请您带路吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC608EC6B6C8C8285","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:修士奥格列":{"text":"수도사 오그리","source":"修士奥格列","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:修士马克西姆":{"text":"수도사 맥심","source":"修士马克西姆","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:卡列琳娜":{"text":"캐롤라이나","source":"卡列琳娜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":3}}